{"2961830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHADOW LEAP", "steam_appid": 2961830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Leap Through the Night with Your Shadow – Thrilling Shadow Clone Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of night, control the power of shadows as the protagonist dashes around with exhilarating moves, taking down enemies alongside their shadow clones in this fast-paced shadow clone action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/b409ca5c9b40f1e7d8b0656ecf4eab82.poster.avif?t=1764470946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/b409ca5c9b40f1e7d8b0656ecf4eab82.webm?t=1764470946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/b409ca5c9b40f1e7d8b0656ecf4eab82.mp4?t=1764470946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[High-Speed × Thrilling Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run along walls, dash through the air, and race across stages with various moves to smash through your enemies with bold, dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/38e1a892e09d57125fec4fece2132cd9.poster.avif?t=1764470946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/38e1a892e09d57125fec4fece2132cd9.webm?t=1764470946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/38e1a892e09d57125fec4fece2132cd9.mp4?t=1764470946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Shadow Skills]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through stages, unlock shadow skills that allow you to battle alongside your shadow clone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Roguelike Elements]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing each floor, gain random skills to customize your character to your liking. Enjoy exciting action that’s uniquely tailored to you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Leap Through the Night with Your Shadow – Thrilling Shadow Clone Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of night, control the power of shadows as the protagonist dashes around with exhilarating moves, taking down enemies alongside their shadow clones in this fast-paced shadow clone action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/b409ca5c9b40f1e7d8b0656ecf4eab82.poster.avif?t=1764470946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/b409ca5c9b40f1e7d8b0656ecf4eab82.webm?t=1764470946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/b409ca5c9b40f1e7d8b0656ecf4eab82.mp4?t=1764470946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[High-Speed × Thrilling Action]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run along walls, dash through the air, and race across stages with various moves to smash through your enemies with bold, dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961830/extras/38e1a892e09d57125fec4fece2132cd9.poster.av